# ── FMOD vendor integration (public repo: NOT distributed here) ──
# Desk-42 is a PUBLIC repository. The official Firelight FMOD for Unity
# package is vendor-licensed binary content and is deliberately NOT
# committed. Reproduce it locally with:
#     powershell -File tools/fmod/Import-FmodPackage.ps1 -PackagePath <pkg>
# Pinned version, size and SHA-256 are recorded in
# docs/proof-build/D1-AUDIO-INTEGRATION-SPEC.md.
Assets/Plugins/FMOD/
Assets/Plugins/FMOD.meta
Assets/Plugins.meta

# FMOD generated / cache / log artefacts — never authoritative source
# StreamingAssets exists ONLY as FMOD's bank staging target in this project —
# it is created by FmodLocalSettings.Configure and holds nothing else. Ignored
# wholesale, folder .meta included, so a clean clone has no orphaned meta for a
# directory that legitimately does not exist without the SDK.
Assets/StreamingAssets/
Assets/StreamingAssets.meta
Assets/StreamingAssets/FMOD/
Assets/StreamingAssets/FMOD.meta
**/FMODStudioCache.asset
**/FMODStudioCache.asset.meta
*.fmod_logs
fmod_editor.log

# ── FMOD Studio project (FMODAssets/Desk42) ──
# Lives at repository top level, deliberately NOT under Assets/: Unity would
# otherwise import the Studio project's own .wav and XML as game assets and
# ship duplicates of audio FMOD already owns.
# The .fspro, Metadata/ and the project's own Assets/ audio ARE authoritative
# source and stay tracked: Metadata/AudioFile/*.xml references the .wav by
# path, so a clone without it cannot open or build the project. The only file
# there is the 38 KB non-production technical tone — no vendor payload, no
# authored game audio.
# Everything below is build product, per-user state, or transient.
FMODAssets/Desk42/Build/
FMODAssets/Desk42/.cache/
FMODAssets/Desk42/.unsaved/
FMODAssets/Desk42/.user/
*.fspro.user
**/*.bank
**/*.bank.meta
# guids.txt is regenerated on every build.
FMODAssets/**/guids.txt

# Standalone player output from ProofStandaloneBuild — build product.
/Build/

# Technical verification asset — deterministic build product, not source.
# Regenerate with tools/fmod/New-TechnicalTestAsset.ps1; the expected
# SHA-256 is recorded in docs/proof-build/D1-AUDIO-INTEGRATION-SPEC.md.
tools/fmod/assets/

# Unity batchmode transient scenes
Assets/InitTestScene*.unity
Assets/InitTestScene*.unity.meta
